=== Test 02: Structs & Operators ===
(1,0,0) + (0,1,0) x = 1.000000
(1,0,0) + (0,1,0) y = 1.000000
(1,0,0) + (0,1,0) z = 0.000000
scaled x = 2.500000 (expect 2.5)
scaled y = 2.500000 (expect 2.5)
chained x = 2.500000 (expect 2.5)
chained y = 2.500000 (expect 2.5)
a.dot(b) = 0.000000 (expect 0.0)
a.dot(a) = 1.000000 (expect 1.0)
a x b = (0.000000, 0.000000, 1.000000) (expect 0,0,1)
|(3,4,0)| = 5.000000 (expect 5.0)
norm z = 1.000000 (expect 1.0)
=== Test 02 complete ===
